>> How do you make you're own scrolls?

>	2) make sure about the blessed(ness) of the items (ie blank scroll
>		and magick marker).  Blessed + Blessed makes Blessed. 
>		Blessed + Uncursed makes uncursed, Uncursed + Uncursed
>		makes Uncursed, Cursed + Cursed makes Cursed...etc

This isn't correct.  If either pen or scroll is blessed, the worst you
can do is create an uncursed scroll.  

Think of an objects blessedness as an integer value in the range -1 to 1, 
where 1 represents blessed, 0 represents uncursed, and -1 respresents cursed.  
To determine the blessedness of a newly written scroll, take the sum of the 
blessedness of the blank scroll and the magic marker.  If the sum is:

		 greater than 0, the new scroll is blessed.
		 equal to 0, the new scroll is uncursed.
		 less than 0, the new scroll is cursed.

